  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">IOM will provide applicants with community programme and visa application support as well as travel services and support in accessing settlement services in Australia. Services include providing information, visa form-filling assistance, compiling of all required supporting documentation, completeness checks, fee collection and forwarding and application forwarding and return.</narrative>
  </description>
